{"id":"n93481-1-8","stage":4,"title":"응급조치 · 应急措施","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n93481-1-8-1","ko":"너 인공호흡을 할 줄 알아?","zh":"你会做人工呼吸吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"인공호흡을","meaning":"人工呼吸","explanation":"인공호흡：人工呼吸；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"인공호흡","audio":"/audio/daa77b66d1eca23e9561.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72971","senseId":"1","lemma":"인공호흡","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"줄","meaning":"表示某个方法或实际内容等。","explanation":"줄：表示某个方法或实际内容等。","readings":[{"term":"줄","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91870","senseId":"1","lemma":"줄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"알아?","meaning":"会，能","explanation":"알다：会，能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"5","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"daa77b66d1eca23e","term":"인공호흡","zh":"人工呼吸","audio":"/audio/daa77b66d1eca23e9561.mp3","entryId":"72971","definition":"往呼吸停止或呼吸困难的人的肺部吹进空气的急救措施。","pronunciation":["인공호흡"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"4e04e3938cc9c67e","term":"줄","zh":"表示某个方法或实际内容等。","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3","entryId":"91870","definition":"表示某个方法或实际内容等。","pronunciation":["줄"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"会，能","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"具有能做某事的能力或技术。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7c70b8b91e08852201e7.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n93481-1-8-2","ko":"응. 지난번에 응급조치 교육을 받았거든.","zh":"会啊。上次我参加过急救培训的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지난번에","meaning":"上次，上回","explanation":"지난번：上次，上回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"지난번","audio":"/audio/0c2f1df517822c1fb603.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71316","senseId":"1","lemma":"지난번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"응급조치","meaning":"应急措施","explanation":"응급조치：应急措施","readings":[{"term":"응급조치","audio":"/audio/96bb208023c0d9ab1ecd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"93481","senseId":"1","lemma":"응급조치","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"교육을","meaning":"教育，培训","explanation":"교육：教育，培训；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"교육","audio":"/audio/4da9a75910ede3adef01.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55289","senseId":"1","lemma":"교육","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"받았거든.","meaning":"接，接受","explanation":"받다：接，接受；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"9","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"0c2f1df517822c1f","term":"지난번","zh":"上次，上回","audio":"/audio/0c2f1df517822c1fb603.mp3","entryId":"71316","definition":"以正在说话时为准，指过去的时候。","pronunciation"